1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
 What's going on Porch fam? My name is Isaiah. Uh, some people call me Zay.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,100
 So I'm gonna tell y'all a little bit about me.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:10,100
 I moved to Tampa Bay area when I was in middle school. In college,

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:13,180
 I was DMing the Porch Instagram and they had prompts running at the time and I

5
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:16,140
 ended up going back and forth with a guy on staff named Aaron Collins.

6
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:19,380
 Eventually he gave me his number and we stayed in touch. Later that summer,

7
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:21,340
 I reached out to him again. And during that call,

8
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:23,540
 he mentioned AwakendConference over Labor Day weekend.

9
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:27,340
 He said he'd get me in if I wanted to come check it out. At the time,

10
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,340
 I honestly was like, probably not. But as the summer went on,

11
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:32,700
 I feel like the Lord was prompting me. And looking back now,

12
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,220
 I definitely know it was the Lord prompting me. So I said, why not?

13
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:39,140
 And I came out by myself. I wasn't sure what to expect, but y'all,

14
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,340
 it blew me away for real.

15
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:43,580
 The Porch offered a welcoming space for solo attendees where I met amazing

16
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,420
 people to help us feel loved and valued.

17
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:48,660
 I became friends with several of them and I've stayed in touch since then.

18
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:51,340
 I still have my notes from Awakend because it was that impactful.

19
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,700
 But more than anything,

20
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:56,180
 that was the moment where God really started me on a journey to begin teaching

21
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:58,780
 me what it means to have a deeper understanding of the gospel,

22
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:01,140
 not just intellectually, but personally.

23
00:01:01,140 --> 00:01:05,540
 So I packed up all my things and moved to Dallas in August of 2023.

24
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,980
 Since being here almost three years,

25
00:01:06,980 --> 00:01:09,380
 I have a deeper understanding that the Lord doesn't just love me.

26
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:12,500
 He actually likes me. He desires a relationship with me.

27
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:17,420
 He's not annoyed with me. He's not distant. He wants me. So friends,

28
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:20,820
 my encouragement to everyone in the room and those watching online, pray about it.

29
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:23,660
 Pray what the Lord would have you do about attending Awakend this year.

30
00:01:23,820 --> 00:01:26,460
 Be obedient to what he calls you. You don't know what he could do.

31
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:31,500
 He changed my life. I had no idea I'd be coming back to Dallas, uh, in 2023,

32
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:33,980
 but here I am. And so that's my encouragement for you guys.

33
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:34,620
 Thanks for listening.

